This describes the list set in force, not any installed credential.
state: applied
in force: yes
status generation: 7
server nats-a: generation 7
server nats-b: generation 7
generation: 7
range: foo

switches:
  foo.c mail shared
  foo.c prompt closed
  foo.c status shared
  foo.c heartbeat shared

senders:
  foo.c.core
    allow: foo.d.build
    deny: (none)
    reaches by mail: foo.c.core, foo.c.lead, foo.d.build
    reaches by prompt: foo.d.build
    reaches by status: foo.c.core, foo.c.lead, foo.d.build
    reaches by heartbeat: foo.c.core, foo.c.lead, foo.d.build
    open publish: $JS.ACK.inbox-foo_c_core.deliver.>, $JS.API.CONSUMER.INFO.inbox-foo_c_core.deliver, $JS.API.CONSUMER.MSG.NEXT.inbox-foo_c_core.deliver, $JS.API.DIRECT.GET.KV_mash-directory.>, $JS.API.DIRECT.GET.KV_mash-leases.$KV.mash-leases.foo_c_core, $JS.API.DIRECT.GET.inbox-foo_c_core, $JS.API.DIRECT.GET.inbox-foo_c_core.>, $JS.API.INFO, $JS.API.STREAM.INFO.KV_mash-directory, $JS.API.STREAM.INFO.KV_mash-leases, $JS.API.STREAM.INFO.inbox-foo_c_core, $KV.mash-leases.foo_c_core, $SRV.>, _INBOX.>
    open subscribe: $SRV.>, _INBOX.foo_c_core.>
  foo.c.lead
    allow: (none)
    deny: foo.c.core
    reaches by mail: foo.c.lead
    reaches by prompt: (none)
    reaches by status: foo.c.lead
    reaches by heartbeat: foo.c.lead
    open publish: $JS.ACK.inbox-foo_c_lead.deliver.>, $JS.API.CONSUMER.INFO.inbox-foo_c_lead.deliver, $JS.API.CONSUMER.MSG.NEXT.inbox-foo_c_lead.deliver, $JS.API.DIRECT.GET.KV_mash-directory.>, $JS.API.DIRECT.GET.KV_mash-leases.$KV.mash-leases.foo_c_lead, $JS.API.DIRECT.GET.inbox-foo_c_lead, $JS.API.DIRECT.GET.inbox-foo_c_lead.>, $JS.API.INFO, $JS.API.STREAM.INFO.KV_mash-directory, $JS.API.STREAM.INFO.KV_mash-leases, $JS.API.STREAM.INFO.inbox-foo_c_lead, $KV.mash-leases.foo_c_lead, $SRV.>, _INBOX.>
    open subscribe: $SRV.>, _INBOX.foo_c_lead.>

The reply and plumbing subjects stay open whatever the lists say: a raw client can send data to another address on them. The lists govern who may mail, prompt, probe and watch whom, not who may communicate at all.
